 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? Not at all. Many people start learning a new language in midlife, and you' be among the fast pacers. That's part of the fun. Lots of famous people have strong local accents, and that makes them memorable. Those are lovely choices. Greek is very musical, and the sound changes completely after just a few months. There are great apps that make learning fun, like Duolingo. Or you can pick up a rental DVD with Greek dialogue and follow along.",
